\ Model pickup and delivery with transfer
\ LP format - for model browsing. Use MPS format to capture full model detail.
Minimize
  travel_cost + transfer_cost + fixed_vehicle_cost
Subject To
 c2_request_0: arc_1_2 = 1
 c2_request_1: arc_1_3 + y_1_2_3 = 1
 c2_request_2: arc_2_3 = 1
 c2_request_3: arc_3_2 = 1
 c5_0_1_2: 100000 arc_1_2 - a_1_2 <= 99900
 c6_0_1_2: 100000 arc_1_2 + d_1_2 <= 101900
 c3_1_t_2: arc_1_2 - y_1_2_3 >= 0
 c4_1_t_2: arc_2_3 - y_1_2_3 >= 0
 c9_1_1_3: 100000 y_1_2_3 - a_1_2 <= 99900
 c8_1_2: 100000 y_1_2_3 + d_2_3 <= 101900
 c7_1_2: 100000 y_1_2_3 + d_1_2 - a_2_3 <= 99600
 c5_1_1_3: 100000 arc_1_3 - a_1_3 <= 99900
 c6_1_1_3: 100000 arc_1_3 + d_1_3 <= 101900
 c5_2_2_3: 100000 arc_2_3 - a_2_3 <= 99900
 c6_2_2_3: 100000 arc_2_3 + d_2_3 <= 101900
 c5_3_3_2: 100000 arc_3_2 - a_3_2 <= 99900
 c6_3_3_2: 100000 arc_3_2 + d_3_2 <= 101900
 c10_1_2: a_1_2 - d_1_2 <= -200
 c10_1_3: a_1_3 - d_1_3 <= -100
 c10_2_1: a_2_1 - d_2_1 <= -200
 c10_2_3: a_2_3 - d_2_3 <= -100
 c10_3_1: a_3_1 - d_3_1 <= -100
 c10_3_2: a_3_2 - d_3_2 <= -100
 c11_t_2_1: - 50 arc_1_2 + 50 y_1_2_3 <= 0
 c11_t_2_3: <= 0
 c12_t_2_1: - 100 arc_2_1 <= 0
 c12_t_2_3: - 50 arc_2_3 + 50 y_1_2_3 <= 0
 R27: 200 arc_1_2 + 100 arc_1_3 + 200 arc_2_1 + 100 arc_2_3 + 100 arc_3_1
   + 100 arc_3_2 - travel_cost <= 0
 R28: 50 y_1_3_2 + 50 y_1_2_3 + 50 y_2_1_3 + 100 y_3_1_2 - transfer_cost
   <= 0
 R29: 1000 arc_1_2 + 1000 arc_1_3 + 1000 arc_2_1 + 1000 arc_2_3
   + 1000 arc_3_1 + 1000 arc_3_2 - fixed_vehicle_cost <= 0
Bounds
 a_1_2 <= 2500
 d_1_2 <= 2500
 a_1_3 <= 2500
 d_1_3 <= 2500
 a_2_1 <= 2500
 d_2_1 <= 2500
 a_2_3 <= 2500
 d_2_3 <= 2500
 a_3_1 <= 2500
 d_3_1 <= 2500
 a_3_2 <= 2500
 d_3_2 <= 2500
Binaries
 arc_1_2 arc_1_3 arc_2_1 arc_2_3 arc_3_1 arc_3_2 y_1_3_2 y_1_2_3 y_2_1_3
 y_3_1_2
End
